-- תקנון שירות עובדי הוראה, פרק 8, §8.4 מפקח
-- The supervisor (מפקח): work unit and holidays, the supervision allowance
-- and the seniority a move into supervision carries, the in-service training
-- allowance, and additional work with its savings-fund contribution.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT conventions

§ `8.4 מפקח`

@desc A teaching employee approved for the supervisor grade, as far as section 8.4 asks about it.
DECLARE `supervisor` HAS
    `personal combined salary`  IS A NUMBER @desc the personal combined salary (השכר המשולב האישי); an input
    `position fraction`         IS A NUMBER @desc the share of a full position held in supervision (1 = full)
    `table rate`                IS A NUMBER @desc the percentage the table of section 8.4.6.1 gives this supervisor (in force from 1.1.01); the table is not part of the text this file encodes, so the rate is an input, as a fraction
    `civil-service work unit`   IS A NUMBER @desc the weekly work unit customary for state employees, which section 8.4.1.1 adopts; an input
    `civil-service annual leave` IS A NUMBER @desc the annual rest leave customary for state employees, which section 8.4.1.2(a) adopts; an input

§§ `8.4.1 יחידת עבודה וחופשות`

@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_4__ssec_8_4_1__para_1
GIVEN s IS A `supervisor`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `supervisor's work unit` s IS
    s's `civil-service work unit`

-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_4__ssec_8_4_1__para_2 Heading of paragraph 2 ("חופשות:"); its two subparagraphs carry the rules.

@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_4__ssec_8_4_1__para_2__subpara_a
GIVEN s IS A `supervisor`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `supervisor's annual rest leave` s IS
    s's `civil-service annual leave`

@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_4__ssec_8_4_1__para_2__subpara_b
DECLARE `fixed holiday` IS ONE OF
    `Passover eve`, `Shavuot eve`, `Rosh Hashana eve`, `Yom Kippur eve`, `Sukkot eve`,
    `an intermediate day of Passover`

DECLARE `supervisor action` IS ONE OF
    `take leave on` HAS `the holiday taken` IS A `fixed holiday`
    `exchange a fixed holiday for another day` HAS `the holiday exchanged` IS A `fixed holiday`
    `do additional work`

-- Supervisors receive leave on each of these days; they are fixed leave
-- days and may not be exchanged for others. The prohibition has no time
-- limit.
@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_4__ssec_8_4_1__para_2__subpara_b
GIVEN h IS A `fixed holiday`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `supervisor action`
DECIDE `a fixed holiday` h IS
    (PARTY `the supervisor`
     MAY   `take leave on` x PROVIDED x EQUALS h)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the supervisor`
     SHANT `exchange a fixed holiday for another day` x PROVIDED x EQUALS h
     LEST BREACH BY `the supervisor` BECAUSE "section 8.4.1.2(b): the holiday days are fixed and may not be exchanged for other days")

-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_4__ssec_8_4_1/p1 Heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_4__ssec_8_4_1/p2 Source: collective agreement of 14.12.64.
-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_4__ssec_8_4_1/p3 Source: a deputy director-general's circular of 22.2.1965.

§§ `8.4.6 גמול פיקוח`

-- F-8.4-c: §8.4.6.1 says "a percentage of his personal salary by the
-- table below"; §8.4.6.2(a) multiplies the rate by the personal COMBINED
-- salary. Read as one base: (a) states the multiplication the table is
-- applied by. The table itself is not in the text as the corpus holds it:
-- `table rate` is an input.
@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_4__ssec_8_4_6__para_1 akn:chp_8__sec_8_4__ssec_8_4_6__para_2__subpara_a
GIVEN s IS A `supervisor`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `full-position supervision allowance` s IS
    s's `table rate` TIMES s's `personal combined salary`

`the base paragraph 1 names` MEANS "שכרו האישי"
`the base (a) names` MEANS "השכר המשולב האישי של המפקח"
`paragraph 1 and (a) name the allowance's base in different words` MEANS
    NOT (`the base paragraph 1 names` EQUALS `the base (a) names`)
#ASSERT `paragraph 1 and (a) name the allowance's base in different words`

-- The table applies from 1.1.01; the text gives no table before it.
@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_4__ssec_8_4_6__para_1/p2
GIVEN `the month` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the table applies in` `the month` IF
    `the month` `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2001)

@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_4__ssec_8_4_6__para_2__subpara_b
GIVEN s IS A `supervisor`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `supervision allowance` s IS
    `full-position supervision allowance` s TIMES s's `position fraction`

@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_4__ssec_8_4_6__para_2__subpara_c
GIVEN s IS A `supervisor`
      `the other components of the salary the hourly value is computed from` IS A NUMBER
          @desc the rest of the monthly base from which the overtime hourly value is derived (section 1.24); an input
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `overtime hourly-value base` s `the other components of the salary the hourly value is computed from` IS
    `the other components of the salary the hourly value is computed from` PLUS `supervision allowance` s

§§§ `8.4.6.3 גרירת ותק במעבר לפיקוח`

@desc The moves section 8.4.6.3 says how much seniority they carry.
DECLARE `move into supervision` IS ONE OF
    `teacher in an instruction role to supervision`  @desc subsection (a)
    `teacher-instructor to instructor`               @desc subsection (b)
    `instructor to supervisor`                       @desc subsections (b) and (d)
    `teacher-instructor to supervisor`               @desc subsection (d)
    `school principal to supervision`                @desc subsections (c) and (d): a principal, not a deputy or other role holder
    `deputy or other role holder to supervision`     @desc excluded from (c) by its own words; whether (d) covers it is F-8.4-b

DECLARE `supervision move` HAS
    `the move`                                  IS A `move into supervision`
    `years in the previous role`                IS A NUMBER @desc years of seniority in the role being left
    `years in an instruction role since 1.9.83` IS A NUMBER @desc for subsection (a): seniority as a teacher in an instruction role, counted from 1.9.83
    `seniority ceiling`                         IS A NUMBER @desc the ceiling subsection (d) makes the count subject to; the text says "today 13 years", so it is an input

@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_4__ssec_8_4_6__para_3__subpara_a
GIVEN m IS A `supervision move`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `seniority carried from an instruction role` m IS
    min (m's `years in an instruction role since 1.9.83`) 7

@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_4__ssec_8_4_6__para_3__subpara_b
GIVEN m IS A `supervision move`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `seniority carried between supervision roles` m IS
    m's `years in the previous role`

@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_4__ssec_8_4_6__para_3__subpara_c
GIVEN m IS A `supervision move`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `seniority a principal carries under (c)` m IS
    0.25 TIMES m's `years in the previous role`

@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_4__ssec_8_4_6__para_3__subpara_d
GIVEN m IS A `supervision move`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `seniority carried in full under (d)` m IS
    min (m's `years in the previous role`) (m's `seniority ceiling`)

-- F-8.4-a: (c) gives a principal moving into supervision 25%, (d) "from
-- management to supervision" 100%. Reading adopted: (c) governs a principal.
-- F-8.4-d: (b) and (d) both decide an instructor becoming a supervisor,
-- (b) whole and (d) subject to the ceiling. Reading adopted: (d), the
-- clause that names the move into a supervisor's role; a teacher-
-- instructor becoming an instructor, which (d) does not name, carries his
-- years whole under (b).
GIVEN m IS A `supervision move`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `seniority carried into supervision` m IS
    CONSIDER m's `the move`
    WHEN `teacher in an instruction role to supervision` THEN `seniority carried from an instruction role` m
    WHEN `teacher-instructor to instructor`              THEN `seniority carried between supervision roles` m
    WHEN `instructor to supervisor`                      THEN `seniority carried in full under (d)` m
    WHEN `teacher-instructor to supervisor`              THEN `seniority carried in full under (d)` m
    WHEN `school principal to supervision`               THEN `seniority a principal carries under (c)` m
    WHEN `deputy or other role holder to supervision`    THEN 0

`a principal of eight years moves into supervision` MEANS
    `supervision move` WITH
        `the move`                                  IS `school principal to supervision`
        `years in the previous role`                IS 8
        `years in an instruction role since 1.9.83` IS 0
        `seniority ceiling`                         IS 13

`(c) and (d) give a principal moving into supervision different seniority` MEANS
    NOT (`seniority a principal carries under (c)` `a principal of eight years moves into supervision`
         EQUALS `seniority carried in full under (d)` `a principal of eight years moves into supervision`)
#ASSERT `(c) and (d) give a principal moving into supervision different seniority`

-- F-8.4-b: (c) excludes a deputy and any other role holder; (d) counts in
-- full a move "from management to supervision" without saying whether a
-- deputy's management is that. Reading adopted: a deputy carries none —
-- (d)'s "management" is the principal's, the move (c) names.
`a deputy of eight years moves into supervision` MEANS
    `supervision move` WITH
        `the move`                                  IS `deputy or other role holder to supervision`
        `years in the previous role`                IS 8
        `years in an instruction role since 1.9.83` IS 0
        `seniority ceiling`                         IS 13

`whether a deputy moving from management carries seniority under (d) decides between none and all of it` MEANS
    NOT (`seniority carried into supervision` `a deputy of eight years moves into supervision`
         EQUALS `seniority carried in full under (d)` `a deputy of eight years moves into supervision`)
#ASSERT `whether a deputy moving from management carries seniority under (d) decides between none and all of it`

-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_4__ssec_8_4_6/p1 Heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_4__ssec_8_4_6/p2 Source: collective agreement of 23.10.90.
-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_4__ssec_8_4_6/p3 Source: collective agreement of 18.12.01.
-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_4__ssec_8_4_6/p4 Source: special collective agreement of 10.3.83, annex D.
-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_4__ssec_8_4_6/p5 Source: a Treasury wage-department clarification of 6.5.91.

§§ `8.4.7 גמול השתלמות`

-- The general rules of the in-service training allowance (section 1.26)
-- apply to supervisors too: a supervisor's entitlement is whatever that
-- section gives a teaching employee, an input until section 1.26 is encoded.
@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_4__ssec_8_4_7__para_1
GIVEN `the allowance section 1.26 gives a teaching employee in the same position` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `supervisor's in-service training allowance` `the allowance section 1.26 gives a teaching employee in the same position` IS
    `the allowance section 1.26 gives a teaching employee in the same position`

@desc A research work a supervision-grade employee submits for the in-service training allowance.
@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_4__ssec_8_4_7__para_2
DECLARE `research work` HAS
    `approvable under section 1.26's rules` IS A BOOLEAN @desc it meets the rules set for all teaching employees (section 1.26); an input
    `in the field the employee works in`    IS A BOOLEAN
    `in the field the employee is certified to teach` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_4__ssec_8_4_7__para_2
GIVEN r IS A `research work`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a supervisor's research is approved for the allowance` r IF
        r's `approvable under section 1.26's rules`
    AND (   r's `in the field the employee works in`
         OR r's `in the field the employee is certified to teach`)

-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_4__ssec_8_4_7/p1 Heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_4__ssec_8_4_7/p2 Source: a special director-general's circular of 6.7.84.
-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_4__ssec_8_4_7/p3 Source: a parity committee decision of 1.9.84.

§§ `8.4.11 עבודה נוספת - קופת גמל 18 1/3%`

DECLARE `additional work` HAS
    `approved under the civil-service regulations` IS A BOOLEAN @desc the additional work is permitted under the תקשי"ר
    `with the same owners`                       IS A BOOLEAN @desc the additional work is for the same owners (employer) as the supervision
    `is overtime by virtue of the supervision role` IS A BOOLEAN
    `supervision position fraction`              IS A NUMBER  @desc the share of a full position held in supervision
    `total position fraction`                    IS A NUMBER  @desc supervision plus the teaching that completes it at the same owners
    `was in the 13 1/3% fund before 1.9.84`       IS A BOOLEAN
    `month worked`                               IS A DATE

-- Supervisors may do additional work, subject to the civil-service
-- regulations (תקשי"ר); outside them they may not.
@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_4__ssec_8_4_11__para_1
GIVEN w IS AN `additional work`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `supervisor action`
DECIDE `additional work` w IS
    IF w's `approved under the civil-service regulations`
    THEN PARTY `the supervisor`
         MAY   `do additional work`
    ELSE PARTY `the supervisor`
         SHANT `do additional work`
         LEST  BREACH BY `the supervisor` BECAUSE "section 8.4.11.1: additional work is subject to the civil-service regulations"

-- Until 31.8.84: a full-position supervisor in approved additional work at
-- the same owners (not overtime as a supervisor) earned 13 1/3%.
@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_4__ssec_8_4_11__para_2
GIVEN w IS AN `additional work`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `qualified for the 13 1/3% fund before 1.9.84` w IF
        w's `supervision position fraction` AT LEAST 1
    AND w's `approved under the civil-service regulations`
    AND w's `with the same owners`
    AND NOT w's `is overtime by virtue of the supervision role`

@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_4__ssec_8_4_11__para_3
GIVEN w IS AN `additional work`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `moved to the 18 1/3% fund from 1.9.84` w IF
    w's `was in the 13 1/3% fund before 1.9.84`

-- From 1.9.84 supervisors in additional work earn 18 1/3% "even if" they
-- hold less than a full position in supervision and complete it with
-- teaching at the same owners, the total exceeding one position: "even if"
-- reads the full-position supervisor of paragraph 2 as included, and
-- extends paragraph 2's group only in the position it asks: the work is
-- still additional work the regulations approve (paragraph 1), and still
-- not overtime by virtue of the supervision role (the completion is
-- "בהוראה", in teaching).
@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_4__ssec_8_4_11__para_4
GIVEN w IS AN `additional work`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `qualifies for the 18 1/3% fund from 1.9.84` w IF
        `qualified for the 13 1/3% fund before 1.9.84` w
    OR (    w's `supervision position fraction` LESS THAN 1
        AND w's `approved under the civil-service regulations`
        AND w's `with the same owners`
        AND NOT w's `is overtime by virtue of the supervision role`
        AND w's `total position fraction` GREATER THAN 1)

GIVEN w IS AN `additional work`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `savings-fund contribution rate` w IS
    IF w's `month worked` LESS THAN Date 1 9 1984
    THEN IF `qualified for the 13 1/3% fund before 1.9.84` w
         THEN 40 DIVIDED BY 300
         ELSE 0
    ELSE IF    `moved to the 18 1/3% fund from 1.9.84` w
            OR `qualifies for the 18 1/3% fund from 1.9.84` w
         THEN 55 DIVIDED BY 300
         ELSE 0

-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_4__ssec_8_4_11/p1 Heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_4__ssec_8_4_11/p2 Source: a clarification letter of 21.2.79.
-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_4__ssec_8_4_11/p3 Source: a deputy director-general's circular of 26.9.84.
-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_4__ssec_8_4_11/p4 Source: a supreme parity committee decision of 15.1.85.

§§ `Worked examples`

-- Examples. The salary and table rate are placeholders.
`a half-position supervisor` MEANS
    `supervisor` WITH
        `personal combined salary`   IS 10000
        `position fraction`          IS 0.5
        `table rate`                 IS 0.6
        `civil-service work unit`    IS 42.5
        `civil-service annual leave` IS 26

#ASSERT `supervision allowance` `a half-position supervisor` EQUALS 3000

`additional teaching in 1990` MEANS
    `additional work` WITH
        `approved under the civil-service regulations` IS TRUE
        `with the same owners`                         IS TRUE
        `is overtime by virtue of the supervision role` IS FALSE
        `supervision position fraction`                IS 0.75
        `total position fraction`                      IS 1.25
        `was in the 13 1/3% fund before 1.9.84`         IS FALSE
        `month worked`                                 IS Date 1 10 1990

#ASSERT `savings-fund contribution rate` `additional teaching in 1990` EQUALS 55 DIVIDED BY 300

#TRACE `a fixed holiday` `Passover eve` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the supervisor` DOES `exchange a fixed holiday for another day` `Passover eve` AT 7

§§ `Property checks`

-- The section's rules over their whole finite space: every move into
-- supervision, 0 to 20 years, ceilings of 13 and 20; positions of 0 to 6
-- sixths and table rates of 0 to 100% in tenths; every fixed holiday;
-- every additional work (approved or not, same owners or not, overtime or
-- not, earlier in the fund or not) at 1/4 to 5/4 of a position in
-- supervision and in all, on 31.8.84 and 1.9.84; and every research work.
-- Salaries are placeholders.

`both booleans` MEANS LIST TRUE, FALSE
`every move into supervision` MEANS
    LIST `teacher in an instruction role to supervision`, `teacher-instructor to instructor`, `instructor to supervisor`,
         `teacher-instructor to supervisor`, `school principal to supervision`, `deputy or other role holder to supervision`
`every fixed holiday` MEANS
    LIST `Passover eve`, `Shavuot eve`, `Rosh Hashana eve`, `Yom Kippur eve`, `Sukkot eve`, `an intermediate day of Passover`

GIVEN v IS A `move into supervision`, n IS A NUMBER, c IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `supervision move`
DECIDE `a checked move` v n c IS
    `supervision move` WITH
        `the move`                                  IS v
        `years in the previous role`                IS n
        `years in an instruction role since 1.9.83` IS n
        `seniority ceiling`                         IS c

GIVEN a IS A BOOLEAN, o IS A BOOLEAN, x IS A BOOLEAN, e IS A BOOLEAN, s IS A NUMBER, t IS A NUMBER, d IS A DATE
GIVETH AN `additional work`
DECIDE `a checked additional work` a o x e s t d IS
    `additional work` WITH
        `approved under the civil-service regulations` IS a
        `with the same owners`                         IS o
        `is overtime by virtue of the supervision role` IS x
        `supervision position fraction`                IS s DIVIDED BY 4
        `total position fraction`                      IS t DIVIDED BY 4
        `was in the 13 1/3% fund before 1.9.84`         IS e
        `month worked`                                 IS d

-- 8.4.6.2: the allowance is the table's rate of the salary pro rata to
-- the position, never negative, never above the salary or the
-- full-position amount, never falling with the position; the overtime
-- base grows by exactly the allowance.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN k YIELD
                all (GIVEN r YIELD
                        LET s MEANS `supervisor` WITH `personal combined salary` IS 10000, `position fraction` IS k DIVIDED BY 6, `table rate` IS r DIVIDED BY 10, `civil-service work unit` IS 42.5, `civil-service annual leave` IS 26
                            u MEANS `supervisor` WITH `personal combined salary` IS 10000, `position fraction` IS (k PLUS 1) DIVIDED BY 6, `table rate` IS r DIVIDED BY 10, `civil-service work unit` IS 42.5, `civil-service annual leave` IS 26
                            a MEANS `supervision allowance` s
                        IN      a EQUALS 10000 TIMES (r DIVIDED BY 10) TIMES (k DIVIDED BY 6)
                            AND a AT LEAST 0
                            AND a AT MOST 10000
                            AND a AT MOST `full-position supervision allowance` s
                            AND ((k EQUALS 6) OR a AT MOST `supervision allowance` u)
                            AND `overtime hourly-value base` s 5000 EQUALS 5000 PLUS a)
                    (range 0 10))
            (range 0 6)

`the table runs from its day and not the day before` MEANS
        `the table applies in` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2001)
    AND NOT `the table applies in` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2000)
#ASSERT `the table runs from its day and not the day before`

-- 8.4.6.3 over every move: never negative, never more than the years
-- served, never falling with them; (a) never past 7 and (d) never past its
-- ceiling. F-8.4-a over the whole space: (c) and (d) agree for a
-- principal only at no years.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN v YIELD
                all (GIVEN n YIELD
                        all (GIVEN c YIELD
                                LET x MEANS `seniority carried into supervision` (`a checked move` v n c)
                                IN      x AT LEAST 0
                                    AND x AT MOST n
                                    AND x AT MOST `seniority carried into supervision` (`a checked move` v (n PLUS 1) c)
                                    AND `seniority carried from an instruction role` (`a checked move` v n c) AT MOST 7
                                    AND `seniority carried in full under (d)` (`a checked move` v n c) AT MOST c)
                            (LIST 13, 20))
                    (range 0 20))
            `every move into supervision`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN n YIELD
                (`seniority a principal carries under (c)` (`a checked move` `school principal to supervision` n 13)
                 EQUALS `seniority carried in full under (d)` (`a checked move` `school principal to supervision` n 13))
                EQUALS (n EQUALS 0))
            (range 0 20)

-- F-8.4-d: (b) carries an instructor's seniority into a supervisor's
-- role whole, and (d) carries the same move in full "subject to the
-- ceiling". Over 0 to 20 years and both ceilings, they agree exactly up
-- to the ceiling.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN n YIELD
                all (GIVEN c YIELD
                        LET m MEANS `a checked move` `instructor to supervisor` n c
                        IN  (`seniority carried between supervision roles` m EQUALS `seniority carried in full under (d)` m)
                            EQUALS (n AT MOST c))
                    (LIST 13, 20))
            (range 0 20)

`an instructor of fifteen years carries fifteen under (b) and thirteen under (d)` MEANS
        `seniority carried between supervision roles` (`a checked move` `instructor to supervisor` 15 13) EQUALS 15
    AND `seniority carried in full under (d)` (`a checked move` `instructor to supervisor` 15 13) EQUALS 13
    AND `seniority carried into supervision` (`a checked move` `teacher-instructor to instructor` 15 13) EQUALS 15
#ASSERT `an instructor of fifteen years carries fifteen under (b) and thirteen under (d)`

-- 8.4.7(2) over every research work: approved exactly when it meets
-- section 1.26's rules and is in the field worked in or certified for.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN a YIELD
                all (GIVEN w YIELD
                        all (GIVEN c YIELD
                                `a supervisor's research is approved for the allowance`
                                    (`research work` WITH `approvable under section 1.26's rules` IS a, `in the field the employee works in` IS w, `in the field the employee is certified to teach` IS c)
                                EQUALS (a AND (w OR c)))
                            `both booleans`)
                    `both booleans`)
            `both booleans`

-- 8.4.11 over every additional work, before and from 1.9.84: the rate is
-- 0, 13 1/3% (only before) or 18 1/3% (only from); nothing is earned on
-- work the regulations do not approve, or with other owners; no one in
-- the fund on 31.8.84 has less on 1.9.84; and, for the same work, more of
-- the position in supervision never loses the fund.
GIVEN a IS A BOOLEAN, o IS A BOOLEAN, x IS A BOOLEAN, e IS A BOOLEAN, s IS A NUMBER, t IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the fund holds as 8.4.11 says for` a o x e s t IF
        elem r1 (LIST 0, 40 DIVIDED BY 300)
    AND elem r2 (LIST 0, 55 DIVIDED BY 300)
    AND ((a AND o) OR (r1 EQUALS 0 AND r2 EQUALS 0) OR e)
    AND r2 AT LEAST r1
    AND ((s EQUALS 5) OR r2 AT MOST `savings-fund contribution rate` (`a checked additional work` a o x e (s PLUS 1) (max t (s PLUS 1)) (Date 1 9 1984)))
    WHERE
        r1 MEANS `savings-fund contribution rate` (`a checked additional work` a o x e s t (Date 31 8 1984))
        r2 MEANS `savings-fund contribution rate` (`a checked additional work` a o x e s t (Date 1 9 1984))

#ASSERT all (GIVEN a YIELD
                all (GIVEN o YIELD
                        all (GIVEN x YIELD
                                all (GIVEN e YIELD
                                        all (GIVEN s YIELD
                                                all (GIVEN t YIELD `the fund holds as 8.4.11 says for` a o x e s t)
                                                    (range s 5))
                                            (range 1 5))
                                    `both booleans`)
                            `both booleans`)
                    `both booleans`)
            `both booleans`
